f:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-xs italic text-zinc-500","children":"Daman 2026-08-30: 'the analogy I explained to you was right, but I don't think I have live numbered reports. Keep that in the questions, we'll clear it later.' So: the INVOICE-FIRST-TRUCK-LATER mechanism is confirmed by the owner and by SAP (1,055 TransType-13 movements, zero TransType-15 — no delivery note exists, the invoice IS the stock movement). What is NOT ratified is whether ceiling - OnHand - invoiced-not-gated-out (both doors) is the formula JIVO wants to manage space by. No JIVO-side report shows physical occupancy today."}]
